[{:db/id 17592186087832 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-6d887ce5-d0d0-5930-95c7-a392e53a9d69" "question-b4857db7-a62d-50eb-acc9-cbd3a910fcdf" "question-cbea84fd-26bf-5e7a-8622-63b89ac36fbc"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-6d887ce5-d0d0-5930-95c7-a392e53a9d69" :question/id #uuid "6d887ce5-d0d0-5930-95c7-a392e53a9d69" :question/math-academy-id "q-277196" :question/problem "![](images/0a/0ace4ffe981358bf61da04caaaed2c24113e287e22f7c31833bfd68b47218055.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the ellipse given above?\n\n{{field-1}}$=1$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the general equation of an ellipse centered at $(h,k)$ with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nHere, the ellipse is centered at $(3,2),$ the horizontal radius has length $a=4,$ and the vertical radius has length $b=2.$ Therefore, the equation of the ellipse is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{{4}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{4} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-248a1636-b15a-54de-b1f9-65c3504085c9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-248a1636-b15a-54de-b1f9-65c3504085c9" :answer-field/id #uuid "248a1636-b15a-54de-b1f9-65c3504085c9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-b169ab72-71e1-57f7-b127-19d4b9034ed7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b169ab72-71e1-57f7-b127-19d4b9034ed7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b169ab72-71e1-57f7-b127-19d4b9034ed7" :answer/id #uuid "b169ab72-71e1-57f7-b127-19d4b9034ed7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-b4857db7-a62d-50eb-acc9-cbd3a910fcdf" :question/id #uuid "b4857db7-a62d-50eb-acc9-cbd3a910fcdf" :question/math-academy-id "q-72250" :question/problem "![](images/d7/d7f6205559fb8b750cdaf121111065cde50adb0afceb90d8d6f4a42305bfdcd4.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the ellipse given above?" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the general equation of an ellipse centered at $(h,k)$ with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nHere, the ellipse is centered at $(-3,2),$ the horizontal radius has length $a=4,$ and the vertical radius has length $b=3.$ Therefore, the equation of the ellipse is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-(-3))^{2}}{{4}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{{3}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{9} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e3cf30e8-57fc-566e-adbd-a352b278b915"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e3cf30e8-57fc-566e-adbd-a352b278b915" :answer-field/id #uuid "e3cf30e8-57fc-566e-adbd-a352b278b915" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f5e5f7a6-96c3-54af-940a-541dc994dd94" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ddd12127-66d8-5fcb-80c1-a016fbc52f25" "answer-01b3651c-c733-5b49-a154-345b8d98a0ea" "answer-f5e5f7a6-96c3-54af-940a-541dc994dd94" "answer-926e8795-0fcb-5eea-8386-a90864fab8ab" "answer-18c7aee9-61e5-5197-a354-15d93dc615cf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ddd12127-66d8-5fcb-80c1-a016fbc52f25" :answer/id #uuid "ddd12127-66d8-5fcb-80c1-a016fbc52f25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(y-3)^{2}}{6}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-01b3651c-c733-5b49-a154-345b8d98a0ea" :answer/id #uuid "01b3651c-c733-5b49-a154-345b8d98a0ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{9}+\\frac{(y+3)^{2}}{16}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f5e5f7a6-96c3-54af-940a-541dc994dd94" :answer/id #uuid "f5e5f7a6-96c3-54af-940a-541dc994dd94" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{9}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-926e8795-0fcb-5eea-8386-a90864fab8ab" :answer/id #uuid "926e8795-0fcb-5eea-8386-a90864fab8ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{6}+\\frac{(y-3)^{2}}{8}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-18c7aee9-61e5-5197-a354-15d93dc615cf" :answer/id #uuid "18c7aee9-61e5-5197-a354-15d93dc615cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x-3)^{2}}{16}+\\frac{(y+2)^{2}}{9}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-cbea84fd-26bf-5e7a-8622-63b89ac36fbc" :question/id #uuid "cbea84fd-26bf-5e7a-8622-63b89ac36fbc" :question/math-academy-id "q-278311" :question/problem "![](images/58/58be29819a83484e2a524e33c27dc2d890dfc722c28d787afded5bc811f898d8.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the ellipse given above?\n\n{{field-1}}$=1$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that the general equation of an ellipse centered at $(h,k)$ with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\n \n\nHere, the ellipse is centered at $(-2,2),$ the horizontal radius has length $a=5,$ and the vertical radius has length $b=2.$ Therefore, the equation of the ellipse is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-(-2))^{2}}{{5}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{{2}^{2}} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{25}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{4} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0229d740-e80e-5baa-915f-197bb10e0207"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0229d740-e80e-5baa-915f-197bb10e0207" :answer-field/id #uuid "0229d740-e80e-5baa-915f-197bb10e0207" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-b9ed1030-ae2c-52d3-8459-bdbee8d2909f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b9ed1030-ae2c-52d3-8459-bdbee8d2909f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b9ed1030-ae2c-52d3-8459-bdbee8d2909f" :answer/id #uuid "b9ed1030-ae2c-52d3-8459-bdbee8d2909f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{25}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]}]
